  title: "Morning: Commute and Breakfast (6:30 AM \u2013 8:30 AM)"
  info: 'A typical day starts early, with many Singaporeans taking public transport,
    such as the MRT or buses, to work or school. Breakfast is often grabbed from
    a hawker center or kopitiam, featuring favorites like kaya toast with kopi, or
    economic bee hoon for a quick and affordable meal.  '
